# The build context of server/Dockerfile (the remote server image and the
# Compose `server` and `conformance-remote` services) is the repository root.
# Keep git history, local vault state, caches, crash dumps and the
# container-only node_modules out of it; bind mounts are not filtered.

.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
main.js
.dev
.obsidian-cache
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
wdio-logs
docs
core
server/target
server/assets
*.log
.DS_Store
